    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Fran\u00e7ois Gautier est radin ! Economiser le met en joie, payer lui provoque des su\u00e9es. Sa vie est r\u00e9gl\u00e9e dans l\u2019unique but de ne jamais rien d\u00e9penser. Une vie qui va basculer en une seule journ\u00e9e : il tombe amoureux et d\u00e9couvre qu\u2019il a une fille de 16 ans dont il ignorait l\u2019existence. Oblig\u00e9 de mentir afin de cacher son terrible d\u00e9faut, ce sera pour Fran\u00e7ois le d\u00e9but des probl\u00e8mes. Car mentir peut parfois co\u00fbter cher. Tr\u00e8s cher\u2026",
        "english": "Fran\u00e7ois Gautier is a penny pincher! Saving brings him joy, paying makes him break out in a sweat. His life is regulated around the single goal of never spending a cent. But his life takes a whole other direction in a single day: he falls in love and discovers that he has a sixteen-year-old daughter he never knew about. Fran\u00e7ois is forced to lie in order to hide his terrible flaw, and hence his problems begin. Because lying can sometimes be costly. Very costly..."
